OL,3,GNEWSALightning strike sparks fire and
OL,4,Adamages homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FA lightning strike has sparked a fire
OL,7,Fat a house and damaged several others,
OL,8,Fforcing residents to leave.
OL,10,FFirefighters, police and ambulance
OL,11,Fcrews were called to Shepherds Croft in
OL,12,FPortland, Dorset, shortly after 21:35
OL,13,FGMT on Tuesday night.
OL,15,FThe fire service said the lightning
OL,16,Fcaused structural damage to one home,
OL,17,Fforcing four people to leave. Another
OL,18,Fhome's porch caught fire, while a
OL,19,Fstrike on a telegraph pole damaged
OL,20,Fsockets, routers and cabling at other
OL,21,Fhomes. No injuries were reported.
OL,23,APub: 18-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
