OL,3,GNEWSALightning strike sparks fire and
OL,4,Adamages homes
OL,5,
OL,6,FScottish and Southern Electricity
OL,7,FNetworks (SSEN) said it had cut power
OL,8,Ffollowing the strike and 11 homes were
OL,9,Fstill without electricity as they await
OL,10,Fsafety checks.
